+- [x] Add the checkbox and a reusable asynchronous list reload. Clear/replace the list only for the most recent request (request generation or cancellation); consume `overdue` directly. Render dates in `time` elements with `dateTime` and `textContent`; render status text exactly `überfällig`.
+- [x] Run `npm test`. In Playwright verify past/today/future/completed/undated rows, exact labels/dates, checkbox on/off, an empty filtered result, date editing/removal and completion after reload. Delay requests to exercise rapid checkbox changes; verify final selection and list agree. Test a title containing HTML renders as text.
+- [x] Record successful full and filtered browser assertions in the implementation summary and stop the app. Screenshot paths outside the repository were denied by the browser tool; observations are the evidence. No browser artifacts remain in the repository.
+- [x] Commit as `feat: show due dates and filter overdue todos`.
+
+## Finish
+
